bindings.ldn, adapters.c, exports.h and bindings.json are generated by
refine bindings from STMicroelectronics's stm32h753xx.h and
system_stm32h7xx.h, Apache-2.0 (devices/notices/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.stm32h7),
Arm's CMSIS-Core headers, Apache-2.0
(devices/notices/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.cmsis), as pinned in devices/inputs.json,
and this directory's landin-vfp.h; bindings/README.md says how to regenerate
them.
